### Base Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000/api/v1

### 1. Health Check
GET http://localhost:3000/health

### 2. Register New User
# @name register
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Hamza Tariq",
  "email": "hamzahakim@example.com",
  "password": "Password123!"
}

### 3. Duplicate Email Registration Test (Should return 409 Conflict)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Hamza Duplicate",
  "email": "hamza@example.com",
  "password": "Password123!"
}

### 4. Login With Valid Credentials (Sets HTTP-only Cookie)
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "hamza@example.com",
  "password": "Password123!"
}

### 5. Login With Invalid Password (Should return 401 Unauthorized)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "hamza@example.com",
  "password": "WrongPassword999!"
}

### 6. Get Current User Profile (Protected Route - Uses Cookie from Login)
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/me

### 7. Unauthenticated Profile Request (Should return 401 Unauthorized)
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/me

### 8. Logout & Revoke Session (Blacklists token and clears cookie)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/logout

### 9. Attempt Accessing Profile with Revoked Token (Should return 401 Unauthorized)
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/me

### =======================================================
### PHASE 3: BANK ACCOUNT MANAGEMENT & FAUCET DEPOSIT
### =======================================================

### 8. Get All Accounts for Logged-In User
GET {{baseUrl}}/accounts/me

### 9. Create Secondary Checking Account
POST {{baseUrl}}/accounts
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "accountType": "CHECKING",
  "currency": "USD"
}

### 10. Attempt Duplicate Account Creation (Should return 409 Conflict)
POST {{baseUrl}}/accounts
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "accountType": "CHECKING",
  "currency": "USD"
}

### 11. Deposit Faucet ($500.00 = 50,000 cents) - Replace with your account ID
POST {{baseUrl}}/accounts/REPLACE_WITH_ACCOUNT_ID/deposit
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "amountInCents": 50000
}

### =======================================================
### PHASE 4: DOUBLE-ENTRY LEDGER & BALANCE AGGREGATION
### =======================================================

### 12. Get Account Balance (Calculated via Aggregation Pipeline: Credits - Debits)
GET {{baseUrl}}/accounts/REPLACE_WITH_ACCOUNT_ID/balance

### 13. Unauthorized Balance Query (Accessing with another user's cookie -> 403 Forbidden)
GET {{baseUrl}}/accounts/REPLACE_WITH_ANOTHER_USER_ACCOUNT_ID/balance

### =======================================================
### PHASE 5: ACID TRANSACTION TRANSFERS & IDEMPOTENCY
### =======================================================

### 14. Atomic Money Transfer ($100.00 = 10,000 cents)
POST {{baseUrl}}/transactions/transfer
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: idemp-manual-test-01

{
  "senderAccountId": "REPLACE_WITH_SENDER_ACCOUNT_ID",
  "receiverAccountId": "REPLACE_WITH_RECEIVER_ACCOUNT_ID",
  "amountInCents": 10000,
  "description": "Payment for consulting services"
}

### 15. Duplicate Transfer with Same Idempotency-Key (Returns Cached 200 OK)
POST {{baseUrl}}/transactions/transfer
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: idemp-manual-test-01

{
  "senderAccountId": "REPLACE_WITH_SENDER_ACCOUNT_ID",
  "receiverAccountId": "REPLACE_WITH_RECEIVER_ACCOUNT_ID",
  "amountInCents": 10000
}

### 16. Get Transaction History for Current User
GET {{baseUrl}}/transactions/history?page=1&limit=10

### 17. Get Single Transaction Receipt by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/transactions/REPLACE_WITH_TRANSACTION_ID


